  "readmeFile": "DetectiveAI.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release of the DetectiveAI.  This version includes basic analysis techniques for assessing potential AI-generated text. Includes methods for analyzing sentence structure, word diversity, and the presence of suspicious phrases.  Further enhancements will include more sophisticated NLP techniques for more robust AI detection.",
